# trained-model weights are rebuilt at Docker build time (see ../Dockerfile) rather than
# committed — keeps the git repo free of large binaries. confusion_matrix.png stays tracked:
# it's small and the model card links to it as evidence of a real training run.
pytorch_classifier/checkpoints/*/
pytorch_classifier/data/labeled_pairs.csv

